        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jean-Claude Andro, Georges Bernanos, Lucy Maud Montgomery\n- Books: Christ des ténèbres, Anne of Green Gables\n- Places: Avonlea\n- Roles: authors, translator\n\nFacts:\n- Jean-Claude Andro translated the book Christ des ténèbres into French.\n- Georges Bernanos wrote Christ des ténèbres.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was also an author.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery wrote Anne of Green Gables.\n- The fictional community Avonlea is the setting of Anne of Green Gables.",
